{
 "encounter_id": "00871",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good morning. I'll be exact. Three weeks ago I had a heart attack, a stent was placed, and I'm now on aspirin and clopidogrel, and I'm bruising a great deal. I wish to know if that is expected."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's a very clear summary, thank you. Where are the bruises?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mostly on my forearms and shins. Some quite large, the size of a palm. I haven't knocked myself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other bleeding, nosebleeds, gum bleeding, blood in your urine, or black stools?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No nosebleeds. Occasionally a little blood when I brush my teeth. No black stools. No blood in the urine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain since discharge?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking? Please list everything."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Aspirin, 75 mg, once a day. Clopidogrel, 75 mg, once a day. And atorvastatin, 80 mg, at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, until the heart attack."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the procedure itself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A stent in the right coronary artery, three weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any shortness of breath, palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Neither."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness lying flat?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse and pressure. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 68, blood pressure 124 over 74, temperature 36.5, oxygen 98 percent, weight 80 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Excellent. Show me the bruises.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There are several flat purple bruises on the forearms and shins, the largest about eight centimetres, and the skin is otherwise intact, no tenderness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "No. Bruising is expected on two blood-thinning drugs, and it's not a sign that something is wrong. I'd say these are medication-related bruises, and your other bleeding is minor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Should I stop one of them? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Absolutely not. The stent needs both, usually for at least a year, to stop it clotting. Stopping early can cause another heart attack. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. I'll carry on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Use a soft toothbrush, wear long sleeves for gardening, and avoid ibuprofen and other anti-inflammatory painkillers."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I do take ibuprofen for my knee. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please stop, and use paracetamol instead."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I shall. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your heart clinic will check your tablets. If you bleed heavily, vomit blood, pass black stools, or get a severe headache, go to the emergency department at once."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. Thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks, to check on the bruising."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
